# Local content-tooling configuration (repository root .env is the canonical
# source for these values — see CR-021; web/.env stays web-specific).

# Path to the publishable content directory: the folder that directly contains
# pages/, posts/, technical-sessions/ and index.md. Relative paths resolve
# against this repository's root. Once publishable Markdown moves to the
# mylifeindigital.content repository (CR-020), point this at that checkout:
#
#CONTENT_DIR=../mylifeindigital.content/content
#
# While content still lives in this repository, tooling falls back to ./content
# when CONTENT_DIR is not set.
